=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# runall screen-hardened ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Run All. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. Everything$
# already as hardn.yml asks: root login off, ufw on, the$
# nameservers set, updates on. sshPort 2230, as sshd has it.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Already as asked$
   -  Firewall             Already as asked$
   -  SSH Login            Already as asked$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         Already as asked$
   -  DNS                  Already as asked$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Nothing to change$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0 or q]:$
$
$

